iteboard?"}),(0,o.jsx)(tT.k,{className:tx})]}),(0,o.jsxs)("p",{children:["FigJam offers plenty of tools to make ideation and collaboration easy and fun. Some of the most popular tools include:"," "]}),(0,o.jsxs)("ul",{children:[(0,o.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("strong",{children:"Drawing tools."})," The marker, highlighter, and washi tape tools can add personality and emphasize important information on your board."," "]}),(0,o.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("strong",{children:"Sticky notes."})," Similar to physical sticky notes, stickies on FigJam can be placed anywhere on your board, offering a quick way to jot down ideas, notes, and to-dos or give feedback to team members."," "]}),(0,o.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("strong",{children:"Collaboration."})," FigJam offers tons of collaboration features, like comments, chats, stamps, stickers, and audio calls to keep teams engaged and connected."," "]}),(0,o.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("strong",{children:"AI."})," FigJam\u2019s Generate tool saves time by creating mind maps, flowcharts, and other diagrams based on the given prompt."," "]}),(0,o.jsxs)("li",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("strong",{children:"Templates."})," FigJam has over 300 pre-made templates, from meeting notes and brainstorming to strategic planning and diagramming. These templates give you a starting point to organize ideas."]})]})]}),(0,o.jsxs)("details",{className:tS,children:[(0,o.jsxs)("summary",{children:[(0,o.jsx)("span",{className:tA,id:"31-how-does-the-select-button-work",children:"How does the Select button work?"}),(0,o.jsx)(tT.k,{className:tx})]}),(0,o.jsxs)("p",{children:["When opening a FigJam whiteboard, the cursor that pops up by default is the Select tool. The Select tool allows you to select, move, and resize any objects on your board. Simply click on the object to select it and change its properties. To select multiple objects at once, click and drag your cursor around the items you want to select. You can also select an object, t